soptools (0.0.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * sopwin GUI: reorganize menus into File, Procedure, View, and Help.
  * sopwin GUI: add project Open/Save/Revert and SOP Load with keyboard shortcuts.
  * sopwin GUI: persist workflow position and step state under
    .config/sopwin/<sopname>.conf; write shell logs to
    .config/sopwin/<sopname>/<id>.log.
  * sopwin GUI: improve workflow graph layout, edge routing, arrows, and
    auto-scroll to the current step.
  * sopwin GUI: View menu adds Toggle Graph (F2) and Toggle Loggings (Ctrl+L).
  * sopwin GUI: replace Detach menu items with pane-header detach icons for
    Graph and Loggings; closing a detached window re-attaches the pane.
  * sop_model: use zero-padded unique step ids (for example 000sh, 020gpt).

 -- Lenik <pub.lenik@bodz.net>  Mon, 31 Aug 2026 21:30:00 +0800

